## 🌐 PROXY CONFIGURATION

**File:** `proxy.conf.js`

```javascript
const forwardUrl = "http://192.168.1.31:8080";      // ⚠️ Backend REST API
const wsForwardUrl = "ws://192.168.1.31:8080";      // ⚠️ Backend WebSocket

const PROXY_CONFIG = {
  "/api": {                    // REST API endpoints
    "target": forwardUrl,
    "secure": true,
    "changeOrigin": true
  },
  "/api/ws": {                 // WebSocket connection
    "target": wsForwardUrl,
    "ws": true,
    "secure": true,
    "changeOrigin": true
  },
  "/static/rulenode": {        // Rule node UI resources
    "target": forwardUrl,
    "secure": true,
    "changeOrigin": true
  },
  "/static/widgets": {         // Widget bundle resources
    "target": forwardUrl,
    "secure": true,
    "changeOrigin": true
  },
  "/oauth2": {                 // OAuth2 authentication
    "target": forwardUrl,
    "secure": true,
    "changeOrigin": true
  },
  "/login/oauth2": {           // OAuth2 login
    "target": forwardUrl,
    "secure": true,
    "changeOrigin": true
  }
};
```

### **⚙️ Cách Cấu Hình Proxy:**

**Cho Local Development (Backend chạy localhost:9090):**
```javascript
const forwardUrl = "http://localhost:9090";
const wsForwardUrl = "ws://localhost:9090";
```

**Cho Remote Server:**
```javascript
const forwardUrl = "http://192.168.1.31:8080";
const wsForwardUrl = "ws://192.168.1.31:8080";
```

