## 🔌 API COMMUNICATION

### **HTTP Services**

**Base URL:** Configured via proxy (`/api`)

**Example Service:**
```typescript
@Injectable()
export class DeviceService {
  constructor(private http: HttpClient) {}

  getDevices(pageLink: PageLink): Observable<PageData<Device>> {
    return this.http.get<PageData<Device>>('/api/devices', {
      params: pageLink.toQuery()
    });
  }

  saveDevice(device: Device): Observable<Device> {
    return this.http.post<Device>('/api/device', device);
  }
}
```

### **WebSocket Communication**

**Connection:** `/api/ws`

**Message Format:**
```typescript
{
  cmdId: number,
  data: {
    keys: string[],        // Telemetry keys
    tsSubCmds: [...],      // Time-series subscriptions
